      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/new-zealand-vs-india-2026-27/aakash-chopra-explains-why-gurnoor-brar-is-troubling-new-zealand-batters-12299521#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
