       <h1>Bhiwani Girl Achieves AIR 15 in NDA, Clears SSB in Fourth Attempt</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Careers</span> <span>#NDA</span> <span>#SSB</span></div>
       <p>A Bhiwani girl has achieved a significant milestone by securing All India Rank (AIR) 15 in the National Defence Academy (NDA) examination, according to The Times of India. This accomplishment highlights her academic and competitive prowess in a demanding national selection process.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-08/bhiwani-girl-achieves-air-15-in-nda-clears-ssb-in-fourth-att.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Her success in the NDA examination was further solidified by clearing the Services Selection Board (SSB) interview. Notably, this achievement came on her fourth attempt, demonstrating persistence and dedication.</p><p>The Times of India reported this significant educational and career advancement, noting the girl's determined journey.</p><p>What to watch: Future admissions and selection cycles.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately conveys the source information about the student's achievement and attempt count.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
