       <h1>IAF IL-76MD Heavy-Lift Aircraft Makes Record Landing in Ladakh</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#IAF</span> <span>#Ladakh</span> <span>#aviation history</span> <span>#IL-76MD</span></div>
       <p>The Indian Air Force (IAF) has marked a significant achievement in aviation history with a record landing at Ladakh's Nyoma Airfield. This landmark event involved an IL-76MD Heavy-Lift Aircraft.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-08/iaf-il-76md-heavy-lift-aircraft-makes-record-landing-in-lada.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The successful operation at Nyoma Airfield underscores the capabilities of the IAF and its heavy-lift assets in challenging high-altitude environments. This landing establishes a new benchmark for aviation operations in the region.</p><p>The development is seen as enhancing the operational readiness and logistical support infrastructure within Ladakh, a strategically vital area.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately reports the event, aircraft model, and location as provided in the source summary.</p>
