       <h1>Rashmika Mandanna and Vijay Deverakonda Celebrate Diwali in Japan</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Celebrity couple Rashmika Mandanna and Vijay Deverakonda are currently vacationing in Japan, where they shared Diwali greetings with fans. Mandanna posted a video and romantic photos, while Deverakonda shared images of himself performing a Homam ritual during the holiday.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-08/rashmika-mandanna-and-vijay-deverakonda-celebrate-diwali-in-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Other prominent South Indian stars, including Ram Charan, Jr NTR, Chiranjeevi, and Allu Arjun, also extended Diwali wishes to their followers. The couple, who took a break from their busy professional shooting schedules for the family trip, expressed hopes for their fans' health and prosperity.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate summary of the celebrity social media activity mentioned in the source.</p>
